      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_22",
      "quote": "Even so, more well-designed multi-centred RCTs are needed to produce strong evidence that could influence clinical practice.",
      "reason": "Some uncertainty/knowledge gaps are implied by the need for stronger evidence from future multi-centre RCTs, but the broader current state of knowledge and important uncertainties are not described in detail."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_22",
      "quote": "The results of this systematic review are by and large consistent with the results seen in the previous retrospective studies and meta-analyses [22-24]. However, previous studies [23-25] only included three of the RCTs and reported on 61 patients whilst this study includes 4 RCTs with 157 patients in total. Hence, our study is more conclusive than these previous studies due to the larger number of patients involved in surgical fixation.",
      "reason": "The evidence gives a rationale related to why a review is needed to provide more conclusive evidence, but it does not clearly and explicitly explain the overall importance and need for conducting the review in the context of existing knowledge."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_22",
      "quote": "The results of this systematic review are by and large consistent with the results seen in the previous retrospective studies and meta-analyses [22-24]. However, previous studies [23-25] only included three of the RCTs and reported on 61 patients whilst this study includes 4 RCTs with 157 patients in total.",
      "reason": "The manuscript explicitly discusses prior reviews/meta-analyses and explains how the current work differs (more RCTs/patients), thereby explaining the need for the current review in light of existing evidence."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No proposed mechanism of action of surgical fixation (as a treatment effect pathway) is described in the retrieved evidence."
