      "reason": "The planned comparisons are explicitly stated as surgical fixation versus non-surgical interventions (appropriate for a PICO-style comparison), along with the population (adult flail chest) and outcomes of interest (safety and efficacy)."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 86
